From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Prithwiraj Samanta <prskid1000@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 08:29:39 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] telecode: slots edited in place, slot hatching and
 suggestions; live fills

Slots no longer go through instance swaps: telecode_slot_create marks a
frame in a component, instances fill it with real layers (JSX, moved
layers or an instance of a component) that are edited on the canvas and
saved per instance; a layer drawn or dropped into an unfilled slot fills
it. telecode_slot_suggest (preferred components by name, then the
document's), _prefer, _remove; empty slots are posted as td-editor:slots
for hatching. Fills: telecode_fill_uniforms and telecode_fill_mesh_edit
(begin/move/end drags are one undo step), controls and inputs in
telecode_fill_list, an animation loop that only runs while an animated
fill is on screen and the tab is visible (repaint, never autosave), the
export rasteriser, and the HTML export draws shader and mesh fills live
(WebGL runtime) over their PNG.
