+/**
+ * Editor-side runtime for slots and procedural fills (telecode / TeleDesign).
+ *
+ *  - Empty slots (component slot frames and instance clones with no layers) are
+ *    posted to the host as `td-editor:slots` so the shell can hatch them.
+ *  - A layer drawn, pasted or dropped into an instance's unfilled slot fills
+ *    that slot (the instance keeps it as its own content, see slots.ts).
+ *  - Shader fills that read `@time` / `@mouse` are animated: a frame loop runs
+ *    only while such a fill is on the current page, inside the viewport, and the
